  "section_notes": "S1 is strict on reporting and customer notice with no phase-in. S2 requires 55 °C testing and exact per-model rates to customers/regulators, but >5% failures only trigger corrective action, not market withdrawal. S3 new-unit shut-off is 24 months and retrofit 72 months; S4 requires built-in suppression from 36 months; S5 mandates recall above 8/100k with prompt notice and no transition."
